sentences.l:
and she, into Achilles,
nectar into his chest and lovely ambrosia,
dripped, so that joyless hunger might not come to his knees;

And as when from the sea a gleam to sailors may appear
of a burning fire, which burns high on the mountains
in a lonely steading;

And he, taking in his hand the shining whip, well-fitted,
sprang up upon the pair of horses,
Automedon;
